UpHill helps health professionals to provide high-quality, safe and evidence-based care.

With more than 120 000 users around Europe, UpHill supports individual and team clinical decision-making and gives healthcare institutions the means to provide evidence-based care.

Working as interactive clinical recommendations, our evidence-based pathways guide your clinical reasoning while treating or diagnosing a particular patient, and give you the best practices in each critical point of the journey.

UpHill allows you to:
- Support your decisions with interactive and evidence-based recommendations;
- Get your scores while following a clinical pathway or access medical calculators directly;
- Access summarized and curated evidence;
- Train and boost your skills.

Use your UpHill account for FREE and explore what’s new for your specialty, or for your hospital, whenever you need it: to better decide and train.

